        """
}
mapping "H333A.1" source="H333A" target="302888003" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source H333A = round or oval retinal holes, single or multiple (without detachment). Target
        SNOMED CT 4120318 (concept_code 302888003) = Retinal round hole. The target is the parent concept
        for round holes (parent of 374641 SNOMED CT 302888003); it fully subsumes the source's morphology
